    lede: 'Beyond networks · Beyond genres · Beyond cities. The call opens in December 2026.',
    avisoT: 'Not open yet',
    avisoP: 'The ADAR NEXT call opens in December 2026, with the full guidelines and the application form. This page explains the project so you can start preparing your proposal.',
    avisoP2: 'In the meantime the usual route stays open, free and with no deadline:',
    avisoLink: 'artistic proposals',
    queH: 'What it is',
    queP1: 'An international open call for musicians, ensembles, visual artists and creators of any discipline, nationality, age and career stage. The selected projects are presented at the summer edition of Festival ADAR 2027.',
