    porqueP1: 'We receive at least five proposals a day. As in almost every cultural organisation, much of what we programme reaches us through professional relationships, recommendations and encounters.',
    porqueP2: 'ADAR NEXT exists to widen that horizon and find artists outside our usual networks. That is why every proposal is read individually by at least one member of the artistic team, and every one of them gets an answer.',
    porqueP3: 'The conditions for applying are published in December, together with the guidelines.',
